---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — QuantClarity"
  description="QuantClarity stores no visitor information and uses no cookies, analytics, browser persistence, or click tracking."
  currentPath="/privacy"
>
  <article class="prose shell">
    <header class="page-header flush">
      <p class="eyebrow">Zero visitor data</p>
      <h1>Privacy by not collecting</h1>
      <p class="lede narrow">
        QuantClarity stores no visitor information and performs no visitor
        analytics.
      </p>
    </header>
    <h2>What this service does not collect</h2>
    <p>
      There are no accounts, cookies, browser-storage identifiers, analytics,
      advertising pixels, session replay, request logs, traces, click tracking,
      or visitor profiles. Search and filter values are not retained by
      QuantClarity.
    </p>
    <h2>Necessary request delivery</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare transiently processes network data needed to deliver and
      protect each request as QuantClarity’s infrastructure processor.
      QuantClarity does not copy source addresses or derived actor keys into its
      storage, logs, metrics, alerts, or artifacts.
    </p>
    <h2>Provider destinations</h2>
    <p>
      Outbound provider links open directly without a referrer or
      visitor-specific identifier. A provider destination operates under its own
      privacy practices. Any commission link is disclosed beside the link and
      uses one static program identifier for every visitor.
    </p>
    <div class="notice" role="note">
      <strong>Release gate:</strong> Controller identity, legal contact, transfer
      terms, rights-request procedure, and retention/accountability records must be
      finalized before this working notice is published to production.
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
